{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01220","headline":"相和歌辞  苦寒行 · 僧齐己","name":"相和歌辞  苦寒行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冰峰撑空寒矗矗，雪凝水冻埋海陆。\n杀物之性，伤人之慾。\n既不能断绝蒺藜荆棘之根株，又不能展凤皇麒麟之拳局。\n如此则何如爲和煦，爲膏雨。\n自然天下之荣枯，融融於万户。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}